      "text": "{\"schema\":\"meaning-model-story-author-record/v1\",\"kind\":\"decision\",\"text\":\"Faye's open decision was drawn, not chosen: cut.faye.2025.daughter_app.response (faye-titcombe-life r1, 65cbe4fe) with seed 'rabbit-hole-run/faye/daughter-app/2025-09', u=0.2055, realized learn_it_beside_her (first draw, no reroll). The draw could not be recorded in a graph bound to her model because her life model has no graph of its own, so the full draw result is kept here and the continuation (ev.faye.learn_beside) carries a realizes_forecast relation in r2 (4d462a80). Remaining author-life questions and why they stay: the nine slow processes are described on their Events and opened where the causality runs through them (body and partnership in the 2022 adaptation, work in the redundancy arc); further opening would not change the voice. The weights of cut.faye.2021.pull and cut.faye.2026.why_write are the recorder's authored distributions for an invented persona, not estimates; the direction Cut's weights were fixed before its draw and are not re-estimated afterwards.\",\"data\":{\"draw\":{\"schema\":\"meaning-model-direction-draw/v1\",\"modelHash\":\"65cbe4fe46ca1fbc9be0eaf231a92238ecf9129635a5122c68e87e8551bba2d1\",\"cutId\":\"cut.faye.2025.daughter_app.response\",\"parentEventId\":\"ev.faye.daughter_app\",\"question\":\"What does Faye do when her daughter shows her the trading app?\",\"unit\":\"proposal weight over mutually exclusive continuations\",\"answers\":[{\"key\":\"forbid_it\",\"weight\":0.2},{\"key\":\"learn_it_beside_her\",\"weight\":0.35},{\"key\":\"remainder\",\"weight\":0.15},{\"key\":\"say_little_and_write\",\"weight\":0.3}],\"seed\":\"rabbit-hole-run/faye/daughter-app/2025-09\",\"algorithm\":\"sha256-first-32-bits/v1\",\"u\":0.2054575360380113,\"cumulative\":[{\"key\":\"forbid_it\",\"weight\":0.2,\"from\":0,\"to\":0.2},{\"key\":\"learn_it_beside_her\",\"weight\":0.35,\"from\":0.2,\"to\":0.55},{\"key\":\"remainder\",\"weight\":0.15,\"from\":0.55,\"to\":0.7000000000000001},{\"key\":\"say_little_and_write\",\"weight\":0.3,\"from\":0.7000000000000001,\"to\":1}],\"realized\":\"learn_it_beside_her\",\"realizedIsRemainder\":false,\"drawIndex\":0,\"reroll\":false,\"priorDraws\":[],\"recorded\":null,\"graphHash\":null,\"previousGraphHash\":null,\"graphMutation\":false,\"worldMutation\":false,\"nextStep\":\"Build learn_it_beside_her as the realized continuation and link its Event from ev.faye.daughter_app with a realizes_forecast relation naming this Cut and learn_it_beside_her. A further draw over this Cut is recorded as a reroll.\"}},\"authoringClock\":{\"rootId\":\"story.understanding.c478361e6869af25970682a2\",\"unit\":\"authoring_step\",\"at\":8}}",
