      "text": "{\"schema\":\"meaning-model-story-author-record/v1\",\"kind\":\"idea\",\"text\":\"End of round 2 (19:42 CEST). Made: Faye's life r1-r2 (change arcs, wants under an inner root, places, long developments, concepts and realizations, outlook and threat Cuts, a drawn decision: learn_it_beside_her), her author model (author.model.faye), the author_reader stage with five buttons, the candidates stage (The Exceptions Queue chosen), and names for the three principals: Kieran Hale (Kez), Barbara Ashby, Laura Russell (Lor). Next: name the building society and the chat server; the opening stage with the era marked real (documentary cutoff about 2023) and each real fact used recorded as a report with its source (the March 2020 lockdown and crash, the 2020 yield-farming summer, the November 2021 peak, the May 2022 stablecoin collapse, the June 2022 lending freezes, the November 2022 exchange collapse; the 2019 scam-reimbursement code and 2020 payee checks; banks' limits on crypto payments 2021-2023), real organizations replaced by invented ones; then story model r1 with the three principals' whole lives, the building society, the clearing cycle and the market regime as processes; then aspects, implications with drawn decisions, a twelve-part route through the model's jumps, and the director on the world. Idea to weigh in the opening: DeFi's farming vocabulary (yield farming, harvest, seed phrase, staking) as a second agricultural revolution in which the app domesticates Kieran the way, in Harari's account, wheat domesticated its farmers; and the twelve words of Barbara's card as the twelve part titles.\",\"authoringClock\":{\"rootId\":\"story.understanding.c478361e6869af25970682a2\",\"unit\":\"authoring_step\",\"at\":15}}",
