wn novelist's name.\"},{\"name\":\"Jade Kempster\",\"seedConnection\":\"Jade rhymes with fade; the hard k of Kempster gives the soft first name a spine.\",\"fit\":\"Kempster is an old Wiltshire and Berkshire occupational surname. Jade became common in England slightly after 1979, so it fits the year less well.\"},{\"name\":\"Dale Webb\",\"seedConnection\":\"Dale keeps fade's vowel and closing d; a dale is a valley that fades into the downs.\",\"fit\":\"Plausible for a boy born in 1979 in Swindon; Webb is common in the county. Flatter on a cover and leaves the persona's gender different from the chosen life.\"}]},\"authoringClock\":{\"rootId\":\"story.understanding.c478361e6869af25970682a2\",\"unit\":\"authoring_step\",\"at\":2}}",
